<title>USA: Loewen withdraws statement, no advice given.</title>
<headline>Loewen withdraws statement, no advice given.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loewen Group Inc said it has withdrawn an earlier statement that said the company has told shareholders to take no action on a hostile bid announced by Service Corp International.</p>
<p>The company said the statement had been released inadvertently.</p>
<p>Loewen said it has not advised shareholders in any manner in regard to the hostile bid.</p>
<p>--Robin Sidel, 212/859-1723</p>
</text>
